        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-note">
        Residential · Commercial · New Launches · Investment Properties
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-card">
      <h2>Looking for your next property?</h2>
      <p>Tell us what you’re looking for and our team will match you with the right options.</p>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="stat-box">
          <span class="stat-number">1,000+</span>
          Properties marketed
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <span class="stat-number">120+</span>
          Projects across Malaysia
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <span class="stat-number">10+</span>
          Years of local expertise
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="services">
  <div class="inner">
    <h2>Our Services</h2>
    <div class="subtitle">End-to-end support for all your property needs.</div>

    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-title">New Project Sales</div>
        <p>Launches and under-construction projects with attractive packages and rebates.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-title">Subsale &amp; Rental</div>
        <p>Ready properties for own stay or investment, plus rental management options.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-title">Developer Collaboration</div>
        <p>Project marketing, sales galleries, and events for developers and partners.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-title">Investment Advisory</div>
        <p>Yield analysis, location studies, and tailored property investment strategies.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="inner">
    <h2>About IQI Malaysia</h2>
    <div class="subtitle">Your partner in every property decision.</div>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <p>
          IQI Malaysia is a real estate agency dedicated to helping clients navigate
          the Malaysian property market with confidence.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our team combines market insights, professional service, and a strong
          nationwide network to deliver results for homebuyers, owners, tenants,
          and investors.
        </p>
        <ul class="bullet-list">
          <li>Experienced, licensed real estate negotiators and agents</li>
          <li>Coverage across key areas in Klang Valley, Penang, Johor &amp; more</li>
          <li>Access to both primary (new) and subsale properties</li>
          <li>Personalized recommendations based on your goals</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="highlight-box">
          <span class="highlight-label">Why choose us</span>
          <strong>Transparent, responsive, and client-focused.</strong>
          <p style="margin-top:6px;">
            We listen to your needs, provide clear information, and guide you
            from viewing to handing over keys and beyond.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PROJECTS / LISTINGS SECTION -->
